    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Iren, a rookie potion maker on their very first assignment! Welcome to Glory Village, a peaceful town thrown into disarray after the mysterious disappearance of the Armis Flower\u2014a golden blossom said to bring joy and fortune to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the annual festival postponed and the culprit still at large, it's up to you and your wise companion Hootie to uncover the truth. Gather magical ingredients, craft unique potions, and help the villagers in charming and unexpected ways as you uncover the secrets hidden within the forest paths, flower fields, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potion Maker Iren is a cozy fantasy RPG focused on gentle exploration, meaningful interactions, and delightful potion-making. Whether you're mixing elixirs, helping townsfolk, or chasing clues, every moment is filled with warmth and wonder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft with Purpose</i>: Collect whimsical ingredients and brew potions to solve quests, heal nature, and aid the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wholesome Story:</i> Uncover the mystery of the missing Armis Flower while growing as a potion maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fantasy Slice-of-Life:</i> Enjoy a slow-paced, heartwarming experience in a beautifully illustrated world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Charming Companions:</i> Partner with Hootie, your owl friend, and meet quirky townsfolk with stories to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Visual Delight:</i> Soft, fairy-tale inspired visuals that create a soothing and immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover magic in the everyday, and bring harmony back to Glory Village\u2014one potion at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Iren, a rookie potion maker on their very first assignment! Welcome to Glory Village, a peaceful town thrown into disarray after the mysterious disappearance of the Armis Flower\u2014a golden blossom said to bring joy and fortune to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the annual festival postponed and the culprit still at large, it's up to you and your wise companion Hootie to uncover the truth. Gather magical ingredients, craft unique potions, and help the villagers in charming and unexpected ways as you uncover the secrets hidden within the forest paths, flower fields, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potion Maker Iren is a cozy fantasy RPG focused on gentle exploration, meaningful interactions, and delightful potion-making. Whether you're mixing elixirs, helping townsfolk, or chasing clues, every moment is filled with warmth and wonder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft with Purpose</i>: Collect whimsical ingredients and brew potions to solve quests, heal nature, and aid the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wholesome Story:</i> Uncover the mystery of the missing Armis Flower while growing as a potion maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fantasy Slice-of-Life:</i> Enjoy a slow-paced, heartwarming experience in a beautifully illustrated world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Charming Companions:</i> Partner with Hootie, your owl friend, and meet quirky townsfolk with stories to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Visual Delight:</i> Soft, fairy-tale inspired visuals that create a soothing and immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover magic in the everyday, and bring harmony back to Glory Village\u2014one potion at a time.</p>",
